      <li><a href={withBase('/docs/framework/')}>Read the lower-level engine details →</a><span>Layout, input, frame gating, motion, textures and Vulkan submission.</span></li>
      <li><a href={sourceUrl('lucent/examples/hello-layer/src/main.rs')}>Read the smaller counter client ↗</a><span>The same framework contracts with a much smaller state and message set.</span></li>
    </ul>
